# credentials — NEVER commit (copy config.example.toml → config.toml and fill it in)
# The GLOB matters: `config.toml` alone left `config.toml.bak` tracked, and a stray backup
# holds the same live access_token / device_key / anon_key as the original. An editor or a
# `cp` is all it takes to create one, and a credential pushed to GitHub cannot be unpushed.
config.toml*

# python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/

# built launcher app (regenerate with build_app.command) — note: NO quotes in .gitignore
SATE Hardware Test.app/
SATE Debugger.app/

# per-run test artifacts
ci-reports/
*.ppm
.DS_Store
